# Archived/superseded trees — kept on disk, deliberately untracked
/archive/

# Frame-level label exports — deliberately NOT published (added 2026-09-24)
#  1. Technical: individual files reach 164 MB, over GitHub's 100 MB hard limit.
#  2. Licensing: these are frame-level annotations derived from MultiBypass140
#     (CC BY-NC-SA 4.0, NonCommercial) including frame paths. Publishing them
#     from a public repository redistributes a derivative of a dataset whose
#     access is gated by a CAMMA data-use agreement. See DATA_LINEAGE.md.
# Regenerate with scripts/lambda_setup/scripts/06_build_labels.py once the
# source dataset has been re-acquired.
/labels/

# Redundant uncompressed copy in the reproducibility deposit: 165 MB, over
# GitHub's limit, and byte-identical to the .gz beside it (verified 2026-09-24).
papers/paper1_neurips2026/reproducibility/labels/*.json
!papers/paper1_neurips2026/reproducibility/labels/*.json.gz

# Local agent/editor configuration — contains absolute paths, SSH hosts and
# infrastructure detail; never belongs in a public repository.
/.claude/
